e hiker some assistance."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le14ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "witness"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who sees an event "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sally was a witness to the incident."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le14ob08aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to follow up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to check something in the future"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: Let's follow up on this next week."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le14ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "incident"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a minor event"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You have to complete an incident report."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le14ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "swollen "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "larger than usual"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Vanessa's ankle is very swollen."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le14ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le14ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Create a 2 minute role play with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Imagine you are a ranger at a national park. Your partner is a hiker who injured himself/herself on a hiking trail."}, {"type": "text", "content": "What is the injury? How can the ranger help?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask for information to use in an incident report."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use the modals should and must to offer suggestions and recommendations."}]}, {"type": "tak